Message 5 : Sat Nov 20 (Frontline)  :: Clan Castle Auction

Wow.  Its been a long time coming, but its finally here. 
On Friday, the 26th at 8:30 PM EST we will be auctioning
off the currently available clan halls to the highest
bidder.  Most of the information you need to know is outlined
in messages 1 and 2 on the board- READ THEM.  Additionally I
will only be accepting bids from one clan member to minimize 
confusion, so I ask that each clan get together and nominate
someone to do the bidding for them, taking into consideration
how much you want to spend.  This person should be able to withdraw
the funds immediately from the clan bank account, which as a reminder
will be frozen at the start of the auction, and you will only be 
allowed to bid out of the money in your clan bank account for the
duration of the auction.
If you have any other questions, send myself or Kjaori a mudmail.
Thanks,
FL


