Message 1 : Thu Jun  3 (Frontline)  :: Clan Halls

I know you all are dying to purchase a new clan hall/castle when they
become available, and I am going to be auctioning them off soon. But first
a few quick pieces of information on the clan halls.

The current allotment of clan halls available to purchase come pre furnished,
with amenities that vary from hall to hall.  Some are lavish, while others are
functional.  Of course this will be reflected in the initial auction price.
Please don't expect to be able to customize your clan hall immediately; the
staff has an awful lot of work to do, I hope you understand.

Each clan hall comes with these things by default:
3 characters may load/quit in the clan hall, others may be added
by paying a "load fee"
If a hall comes with a keyed entry, two keys will be furnished.
These can be rented out with your character.  Additional keys will
be furnished for a fee.  There are NO free reimbursements on hall
keys, so guard 'em with your life. :)

About the auction:  I will announce a date and time for the actual
auction soon.  Most likely it will be in the later pm hours EST, so as

[ Return to continue, (q)uit, (r)efresh, (b)ack, or page number (1/2) ]
to give people playing internationally an option of getting on for it.
All auction funds MUST come from the clan bank account - I will not
accept any bids which a clan cannot cover based upon its bank account
at the start of the auction. A clan is only allowed to buy ONE hall.
There will be no halls sold to individuals, or people not in a clan.
If you wish to form a clan and bid on a castle, please do so BEFORE
the auction date.
That is about it.  We will be publishing a help file soon detailing
the customization options and costs for expanding/modifying your
castle. 

FL


