Castle 1:  The Tower
A private tower located in a quiet section of the woods not far from
civilization.  The Tower has some great features that would make it
a great hall for a powerful clan; or a clan looking to gain some power.
The Tower offers:
    o  Great guardians
    o  Keyed entry, with seperate storage space for initiates, etc.
    o  Organized equipment storage, with a Servant
    o  The Tower is magically warded against detection and attack
    o  fountain
    o  atm
    o  magickal portal to Kir Drax'in

Castle 2:  The Hidden Cave
A cozy little stockade in the mountains on the outskirts of civilization,
this hidden cave is perfect for a small clan, or a group of rebel

